@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### API liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Database + existing source-table readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts

### Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### Q1 - baskets
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights/baskets

### Q2 - comparison
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights/comparison

### Q3 - leaks
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights/leaks

### Q4 - safe-to-spend now + month-end projection
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights/safe-to-spend

### Q5 - what-if
POST {{baseUrl}}/insights/what-if
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurants_pct": 20,
  "shopping_eur": 30,
  "extra_savings_eur": 100
}

### Ask - Q4
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": 4,
  "text": "How much can I safely spend now, and what may I have at month end?",
  "tone": "gentle"
}

### Add an event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Friend's gift",
  "date": "2026-11-16",
  "amount": 40
}

### Get the plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/plan

### Update the plan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "safety_buffer": 60,
  "savings_goal": 100,
  "payday": "2026-11-27"
}


### Start a new conversation (response contains conversation_id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": 1,
  "text": "Where did my money go this month?",
  "tone": "gentle"
}

### Continue a conversation (replace 1 with the returned conversation_id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversation_id": 1,
  "question_id": 3,
  "text": "What are my biggest everyday leaks?",
  "tone": "honest"
}

### List this customer's conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations

### Read messages in a conversation
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/1/messages
